      <title><![CDATA[IRCTC Q2 Results: Net profit falls 23% as Rail Neer swings to loss, catering profit declines]]></title>
      <link><![CDATA[https://www.cnbctv18.com/market/stocks/irctc-share-price-q2-results-net-profit-falls-23-as-rail-neer-swings-to-loss-catering-profit-declines-20032739.htm]]></link>
      <description><![CDATA[IRCTC reported a 22.9% year-on-year decline in consolidated net profit to ₹263.6 crore for the September quarter of FY27, even as revenue from operations increased 16.3% to ₹1,333.1 crore. EBITDA rose just 1% to ₹408 crore, while the EBITDA margin contracted to 30.6% from 35.2%.]]></description>
      <pubDate><![CDATA[Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:13:09 +0530]]></pubDate>
